WEBVTT

00:34:57.197 --> 00:35:00.430
I think the key will be
in President Biden's proposal

00:35:00.430 --> 00:35:01.797
for the build back,

00:35:01.830 --> 00:35:07.297
which will actually fight hard to direct
funds to the investments

00:35:07.330 --> 00:35:13.863
and to the sectors where we want to see
a responsible build back.

00:35:13.897 --> 00:35:16.730
There’s another aspect,
and I think that can be done, Al,

00:35:16.763 --> 00:35:18.030
I really feel that.

00:35:19.430 --> 00:35:21.197
For instance,

00:35:21.230 --> 00:35:24.797
someone who's making a car today
in South Carolina,

00:35:24.830 --> 00:35:26.397
where BMW has plants,

00:35:26.430 --> 00:35:29.097
and just to pick one place or Detroit,

00:35:29.097 --> 00:35:31.263
GM is obviously going to make this shift,